description:
Search RedBison's 500+ tools by keyword: developer utilities, file and media converters, and finance, health, math and engineering calculators. Returns a ranked list with each tool's canonical URL and, when one exists, its in-depth guide. Use this when a user asks 'is there a tool for X?' or 'what RedBison tool should I use to Y?'

Returns: JSON with { query, count, results[] } where each result has { id, name, description, url, category }.
Example input: {"query":"json format","limit":5}
